         <!--Fortunius se vivom fecit / d(omino) n(ostro) Gratiano {ano} aug(usto) IIII et Merobaude cons(ulibu)[s] / deposita est Caelia rari exempli femina quod vides h[ic] / quiescit / Porfurius--><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><ab><lb n="1"/>Fortunius se vivom fecit<lb n="2"/><expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>omino</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>n</abbr><ex>ostro</ex></expan> Gratiano <surplus>ano</surplus> <expan><abbr>aug</abbr><ex>usto</ex></expan> IIII et Merobaude <expan><abbr>cons</abbr><ex>ulibu</ex></expan><supplied reason="lost">s</supplied><lb n="3"/>deposita est Caelia rari exempli femina quod vides h<supplied reason="lost">ic</supplied><lb n="4"/>quiescit<lb n="5"/>Porfurius</ab></div>
